---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro'

const lastUpdated = '2026-09-18'
---

<Page title="Now · Serina McFall" description="What's active right now, what comes next, what's still on the horizon.">
  <article class="now">
    <header class="opener">
      <h1>Now, next, and later.</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated <time datetime={lastUpdated}>{lastUpdated}</time></p>
    </header>

        <section>
      <h2>Now</h2>
      <p>Dev Academy AI Launchpad, 27 July through 13 November 2026. I have just finished the group project on Buzz, an open-source hive-mind communication platform, where I owned the documentation corpus: 233 files covering architecture, schema, standards and capabilities.</p>
      <p>Out of that project came three tools. The Professor, a skill that creates docs, maintains them and vets them in one pass, because docs are my least favourite job and I would rather automate the whole loop than the first draft. A review gate. And a test automation suite that has since outgrown the project entirely. I am finishing all three for myself now.</p>
      <p>Alongside that, Avalúne, my Next.js worldbuilding site, where the accessibility rules are enforced in the build rather than left to memory.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Next</h2>
      <p>The industry placement that sits inside Launchpad: a New Zealand tech company, from October. Production code, a real team, real review.</p>
      <p>Applications are also in for Summer of Tech 2026/27, which starts as Launchpad finishes.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Later</h2>
      <p>The Learning Companion Project, an AI-assisted study tool for neurodivergent brains, built on the agent and worker patterns I have spent this year learning. And the role this site is meant to find me.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Page>

<style>

